macOS / LinuxWindows (PowerShell)Windows (Command Prompt) <p>Current shell only:</p> <pre><code>export RF_TOKEN=&lt;your_api_key&gt;
</code></pre> <p>Persist for future shells (zsh — adjust to <code>~/.bashrc</code> for bash). Open a new shell after running this (or run <code>source ~/.zshrc</code> to apply in the current shell):</p> <pre><code>echo 'export RF_TOKEN=&lt;your_api_key&gt;' &gt;&gt; ~/.zshrc
</code></pre> <p>Current session only:</p> <pre><code>$env:RF_TOKEN = '&lt;your_api_key&gt;'
</code></pre> <p>Persist for future sessions (open a new PowerShell after running this):</p> <pre><code>setx RF_TOKEN &lt;your_api_key&gt;
</code></pre> <p>Current session only:</p> <pre><code>set RF_TOKEN=&lt;your_api_key&gt;
</code></pre> <p>Persist for future sessions (open a new Command Prompt after running this):</p> <pre><code>setx RF_TOKEN &lt;your_api_key&gt;
</code></pre>

